sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Assistant as Assistant (MCP client, same computer)
    participant SDK as mcp_dart StreamableMcpServer
    participant Guard as isMcpRequestAllowed
    participant Tool as McpTool (e.g. list_workouts)
    participant Scope as McpScope
    participant Repo as Repositories (SQLite)

    Note over SDK: Bound to 127.0.0.1 only
    Assistant->>SDK: POST /mcp, Authorization: Bearer <token>

    %% DNS-rebinding rules
    alt Origin header present
        Note over SDK: allowedOrigins is an unmatchable origin,<br/>so any Origin fails
        SDK-->>Assistant: 403
    else No Origin header
        SDK->>Guard: authenticationHandler(request)
        Note over Guard: No Origin header<br/>Host is exactly 127.0.0.1:port or localhost:port<br/>Bearer token matches (constant-time)
        alt Any check fails
            Guard-->>SDK: rejected
            SDK-->>Assistant: 403
        else All checks pass
            Guard-->>SDK: allowed
            Note over SDK: Fresh McpServer per request (2026-07-28)<br/>or per session (2025-11-25)
            SDK->>Tool: tools/call
            Tool->>Scope: resolveClientId(args)
            Note over Scope: Me unless client data access is on
            alt client_id supplied while access is off
                Scope-->>Tool: McpToolError
                Tool-->>SDK: McpToolError
                Note over SDK: Becomes a tool result with isError true
            else Client resolved
                Scope-->>Tool: clientId
                Tool->>Repo: Read-only queries (never writes)
                Repo-->>Tool: Rows
                Tool-->>SDK: JSON map (no GPS)
            end
            SDK-->>Assistant: CallToolResult (structured content + JSON text fallback)
        end
    end
